%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: one capture, two fills. The same instance fills two
% rectangles on one page; the resources hold exactly one pattern and
% both fills reference it, the second without setting it again.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
100 300 200 100 rectfill
showpage
